| BR-11, BR-12, BR-32 (block identity / boundary) | §3.4, §4.4, Appendix B | Designed |
| BR-30, BR-33, BR-34 (tool refs / rule paths) | §5.6.5, §5.6.9, §5.3 | Designed |
| BR-35 (naming) | §5.6.3 (accept + rationale) | Designed |
| BR-37 (config coverage) | §5.6.4, §6.2 | Designed |
| NFR-17, NFR-18 (repeatability) | §8.3, Appendix F.4 | Designed |
